<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Salomon cuts Falcon Drilling.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Salomon cuts Falcon Drilling.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Bros said to have downgraded Falcon Drilling to a buy from strong buy, a source at the company said.</p>
<p>-- Salomon could not be reached for comment and Falcon stock was down 2-5/8 at 36-1/4. ((-- David Chance New York Newsroom 212 859 1902))</p>
